# protocol/01 § Cadence: a device that has not connected for 90 days is removed from every group by
# an instance Remove (90, not the spec chaos list's 30 - deviation D13), and it rejoins by external
# commit. Alice and bob reconnect at day 45; carol stays away. At day 91 only carol is past the
# window: the instance proposes her removal - the group freezes on it, which is how the scenario
# sees it - alice commits it, and carol returns by external commit and reads what is sent after.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group chat kind=text target=dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
join carol chat via=welcome
sync bob
sync carol
go_offline carol
advance_clock 45d
send alice chat nobody is past the window at day 45
expect_decrypts bob chat nobody is past the window at day 45
advance_clock 46d
expect_425 send alice chat carol is past it at day 91
commit alice
go_online carol
resync carol chat
sync alice
send alice chat welcome back carol
expect_decrypts carol chat welcome back carol
